Package: alcedo
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Windward Logic LLC <alcedo@windwardlogic.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Recommends: gnome-keyring
Suggests: hunspell-en-us
Section: mail
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://alcedo.email
Description: Native IMAP/SMTP mail client for GNOME
 Alcedo is a native mail client for GNOME with a unified inbox,
 multi-account support, and privacy-first defaults: remote images and
 tracking pixels are blocked until you opt in.
 This is the free GPL build.
